    1: """Workplace-owned, snapshot-authorized SQLite FTS5 local resource search.
    2: 
    3: The index is resource-oriented: documents are stored once per resource in the
    4: workplace DB. Project snapshots only authorize which resource identities may be
    5: queried; they do not own or duplicate indexed documents.
    6: """
